abstract: >-
  GDPR-compliant framework for cloud-based AI with local data filtering. Personal data remains on your device; Claude only receives anonymized aggregates. Code under the MIT License (LICENSE-CODE); documentation, website and example data under CC BY-SA 4.0 (LICENSE-DOCS). The example data are fictitious.
